      "metaTitle": "Local Governance with Life at the Centre - Melina Àngel",
      "metaDescription": "Bioregionalism and biomimesis offer us an opportunity to rethink local governance from a more harmonious perspective, connected with nature. Melina Ángel reminds us that putting life at the centre of decisions is key to creating models that are sustainable and inclusive, respecting both human needs and ecosystem dynamics. This transformation involves not only listening to territories but also unlearning the structures inherited from colonialism, to advance towards a more equitable relationship with land and communities.",
